# Staging's scheduler (docs/DECISIONS.md VPS-38): root's crontab for BusyBox crond, in UTC, calling
# the web-staging container with staging's own secret. The same lines as production's today, as
# Vercel ran both crons for staging too; a file of its own lets them differ without a compose
# change. cron-call prints one line for each daily or digest call, and for the minute job only
# when it got no 200.
# Daily housekeeping at 03:00 IST, once more at 03:30 IST if the first call got no 200.
30 21 * * * /bin/sh /opt/menumesh/cron-call daily
0 22 * * * /bin/sh /opt/menumesh/cron-call daily-retry
# The platform digest at 08:45 IST, once more at 09:15 IST if needed.
15 3 * * * /bin/sh /opt/menumesh/cron-call digest
45 3 * * * /bin/sh /opt/menumesh/cron-call digest-retry
# Every minute: the restartable jobs (VPS-29); the route answers at once.
* * * * * /bin/sh /opt/menumesh/cron-call jobs
